# Media: keep raw camera masters out of git (GitHub hard-rejects blobs > 100 MB).
# Commit web-ready derivatives instead (e.g. 720p H.264 .mp4 / .gif):
#   ffmpeg -i clip.MOV -vf "scale=-2:720:flags=lanczos" -c:v libx264 -crf 23 \
#          -preset medium -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:a aac -b:a 128k -movflags +faststart clip.mp4
*.MOV
*.mov

# Poster cut-outs: print-size photo copies (originals live in portfolio_assets, web photos are re-downloadable)
innovation_project/04_presentation/poster_photos/
